codex
The exposure strata do not invalidate the arithmetic, but they do change what it estimates: a census average over three deterministic matched windows is coherent; an exposure-gradient estimand is not. I’m now checking whether another frozen, pre-outcome window variable actually has enough support to justify regenerating gen1, and auditing control/injection pairing at the individual-window level.
